                    <Description_ENG>******************************************************************************************************************************
******************************************************************************************************************************
The following modifiers are multiplied with the base explosive damage (&lt;ubDamage&gt;) but they apply ONLY to gas type explosives.
When someone moves through a gas cloud without a gas mask he will receive the modified base damage each tile he moves.
Valid values are from 0.0 to 1.0 (higher is better).
Default is 0.1</Description_ENG>
                </Property>
                <Property name="DAMAGE_BREATH_MOVE_EXPLOSIVE_MODIFIER" datatype="numeric" defaultvalue="0.1"/>
                <Property name="MISS_MAX_RADIUS_GRENADE" datatype="string" defaultvalue="5;">
                    <Description_ENG>******************************************************************************************************************************
******************************************************************************************************************************
The following modifiers define a max miss radius for ballistic explosive handling. Explosives will land within this radius
around the target tile. The better a merc is with grenades or mortar (check the traits) the higher will be his Chance to Hit
and the smaller will be the final radius.
Valid values are from 0 to 30.</Description_ENG>
                </Property>
                <Property name="MISS_MAX_RADIUS_MORTAR" datatype="string" defaultvalue="10;"/>
            </Properties>
        </Section>
